        },
        {
            "text": "Kira! You saved us!",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 23,
            "ImageToShow": 0,
            "musictoplay": 0
        },
        {
            "text": "Joel, are you alright?",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 9,
            "ImageToShow": 0,
            "musictoplay": 0
        },
        {
            "text": "Yes. We hid in the trees, so no one is hurt.",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 23,
            "ImageToShow": 0,
            "musictoplay": 0
        },
        {
            "text": "That's great. What were they doing here?",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 9,
            "ImageToShow": 0,
            "musictoplay": 0
        },
        {
            "text": "The mad king has been coveting our mastery of telekinesis. He wanted us to train his soldier to use it.",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 23,
            "ImageToShow": 0,
            "musictoplay": 0
        },
        {
            "text": "I see...",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 9,
            "ImageToShow": 0,
            "musictoplay": 0
        },
        {
            "text": "We have been meditating for decades to gain such an ability, but he did not wish to hear that.",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 23,
            "ImageToShow": 0,
            "musictoplay": 0
        },
        {
            "text": "So only you guys can use your... How to call it... Long range telekinesis?",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 9,
            "ImageToShow": 0,
            "musictoplay": 0
        },
        {
            "text": "Mostly yes, but I think if you trained a bit you could be able to pull it off.",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 23,
            "ImageToShow": 0,
            "musictoplay": 0
        },
        {
            "text": "Well, that's convenient.",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 0,
            "ImageToShow": 0,
            "musictoplay": 0
        },
        {
            "text": "I've been showing you how to do it for years after all. You won't be able to use it for a long time at first.",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 23,
            "ImageToShow": 0,
            "musictoplay": 0
        },
        {
            "text": "That's fine.",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 9,
            "ImageToShow": 0,
            "musictoplay": 0
        },
        {
            "text": "You probably won't have much of a range at first, but it will probably prove itself to be useful to you. Here, I'll show you.",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 23,
            "ImageToShow": 0,
            "musictoplay": 0
        },
        {
            "text": "Got it. We'll stay a few days, so teach me in details.",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 9,
            "ImageToShow": 0,
            "musictoplay": 0
        },
        {
            "text": "It will be my pleasure.",
            "CameraDestination": {
                "x": 0.0,
                "y": 0.0,
                "z": 0.0
            },
            "characterindex": 23,
